    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, I\u2019m an indie game developer with five cats. This is a free 2D puzzle game where you restore damaged artifacts from various periods of ancient history. Move and rotate the pieces to complete the restoration like a jigsaw puzzle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level showcases a beautifully crafted ancient artifact, accompanied by a brief introduction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: Left-click to move, scroll to zoom, and right-click to rotate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic art style with relaxing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peacefully sleeping cat will always be by your side\u2014come and unwind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, I\u2019m an indie game developer with five cats. This is a free 2D puzzle game where you restore damaged artifacts from various periods of ancient history. Move and rotate the pieces to complete the restoration like a jigsaw puzzle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level showcases a beautifully crafted ancient artifact, accompanied by a brief introduction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: Left-click to move, scroll to zoom, and right-click to rotate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic art style with relaxing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peacefully sleeping cat will always be by your side\u2014come and unwind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Restore ancient artifacts in the company of a cat!",
